  "name": "odd-tile",
  "description": "The mark repeated: a 4 × 3 grid of the mark on the page colour with hairline rules, one tile (param `odd`, 0–11) turned 45° on a square of the accent; the artist and title under the grid. Slots: {name} (artist), {title} (release), {mark}, the palette (bg, text, accent), `odd`. Fonts: Inter Tight (register them as TTF/WOFF; WOFF2 can't be outlined).",
